            <!-- PANEL 4: Technical Design Panel -->
            <div class="doc-panel-section" id="docPanelTechDesign">
              <div class="doc-summary-intro">
                <h2 class="doc-section-headline">Technical Specification &amp; Security Protocol</h2>
                <p class="doc-section-desc">Standarisasi RESTful envelope, model autentikasi JWT + Role Based Access
                  Control (RBAC).</p>
              </div>

              <div class="prd-cards-grid">
                <div class="prd-box-card">
                  <h3 class="prd-card-title" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                      stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                      <rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2" />
                      <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4" />
                    </svg>
                    <span>Authentication &amp; RBAC</span>
                  </h3>
                  <p class="prd-card-content">
                    Setiap request wajib menyertakan Header <code>Authorization: Bearer &lt;JWT&gt;</code>. Token
                    memiliki TTL 15 menit dengan Refresh Token rotasi di cookie HttpOnly.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="prd-box-card">
                  <h3 class="prd-card-title" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                      stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                      <path d="m7.5 4.27 9 5.15" />
                      <path
                        d="M21 8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z" />
                      <path d="m3.3 7 8.7 5 8.7-5" />
                      <path d="M12 22V12" />
                    </svg>
                    <span>API Response Standard</span>
                  </h3>
                  <p class="prd-card-content">
                    Format seragam:
                    <code>{ "success": true, "data": {...}, "meta": {...}, "timestamp": 1788316800 }</code> untuk semua
                    endpoint JSON.
                  </p>
                </div>
                <div class="prd-box-card">
                  <h3 class="prd-card-title" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem;">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                      stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                      <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2" />
                    </svg>
                    <span>Caching Strategy</span>
                  </h3>
                  <p class="prd-card-content">
                    Cache-Aside pattern di Redis dengan invalidasi otomatis saat terjadi mutasi event (Write-Through
                    pada inventory ledger).
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

