            <h3 class="gate-list-title">Requirements &amp; Milestones</h3>
            <ul class="gate-task-list">
              <li class="gate-task-item">
                <input type="checkbox" class="gate-checkbox" disabled />
                <span class="gate-task-desc">Every &sect;D story has EARS/GWT acceptance criteria, testable and tech-free</span>
              </li>
              <li class="gate-task-item">
                <input type="checkbox" class="gate-checkbox" disabled />
                <span class="gate-task-desc"><strong>Fully decided:</strong> zero <code>[NEEDS CLARIFICATION]</code> / "TBD" / "Pending" anywhere in this doc &mdash; every unknown is resolved (&sect;H) or registered (&sect;J). The gate-guard hook enforces this mechanically.</span>
              </li>
              <li class="gate-task-item">
                <input type="checkbox" class="gate-checkbox" disabled />
                <span class="gate-task-desc">&sect;H decision log reflects every interview decision; no duplicate or dangling SD-n</span>
              </li>
              <li class="gate-task-item">
                <input type="checkbox" class="gate-checkbox" disabled />
                <span class="gate-task-desc">&sect;I glossary defines every term &sect;A&ndash;&sect;G use; controlled vocabularies enumerated in full</span>
              </li>
              <li class="gate-task-item">
                <input type="checkbox" class="gate-checkbox" disabled />
                <span class="gate-task-desc">Scope: in/out lists complete; MVP cut line drawn <em>(skippable in quick mode)</em></span>
              </li>
              <li class="gate-task-item">
                <input type="checkbox" class="gate-checkbox" disabled />
                <span class="gate-task-desc">Roadmap + WBS present and consistent with scope <em>(skippable in quick mode)</em></span>
              </li>
              <li class="gate-task-item">
                <input type="checkbox" class="gate-checkbox" disabled />
                <span class="gate-task-desc">Constitution Check passed (no &sect;1&ndash;&sect;7 conflicts)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="gate-task-item">
                <input type="checkbox" class="gate-checkbox" disabled />
                <span class="gate-task-desc">Reviewed by product-manager agent (not the drafting author)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="gate-task-item">
                <input type="checkbox" class="gate-checkbox" disabled />
                <span class="gate-task-desc">Every item above genuinely met &mdash; the owning agent approves and advances (agent-owned gate, constitution &sect;2)</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </main>
